	"nodes":[
		{"id":"home-title","type":"text","text":"# 🏢 AI Content OS\n\nMulti-agent content creation system. **CEO** (main Claude session) orchestrates 4 specialized sub-agents through a content pipeline ending in a mandatory QA loop.\n\n**Stack:** Claude Code · Superpowers plugin · OpenAI Images API · Obsidian vault\n\n*Last updated: 2026-05-20*","x":-300,"y":-100,"width":600,"height":220,"color":"4"},
