		{"id":"agents-info","type":"text","text":"## 👥 Agents\n\n**CEO** — main session, orchestrator\n\n| ID | Name | Domain |\n|----|------|--------|\n| AGT-01 | יעל | Rewriter |\n| AGT-02 | יובל | Images |\n| AGT-03 | חן | Research |\n| AGT-04 | גיא | QA gatekeeper |\n\nContracts: `.claude/agents/`\nDocs: `vault/Meeting Notes/*-agent.md`","x":-1000,"y":200,"width":460,"height":360,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"config-info","type":"text","text":"## ⚙️ Configuration\n\n**Project**\n- `CLAUDE.md` — protocol & routing\n- `.claude/settings.json` — `enabledPlugins`\n- `.claude/settings.local.json` — git allowlist\n- `.env` — `OPENAI_API_KEY`\n\n**User-global**\n- `~/.claude/settings.json` — model, theme, plugins\n- Plugins active: `superpowers` (SessionStart hook), `skill-creator`\n\n**Hooks active:** 1 (Superpowers SessionStart)","x":-200,"y":200,"width":600,"height":360,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"pipeline-info","type":"text","text":"## 🔁 Pipeline at a glance\n\n`חן` → **Content/** → `יעל` → **Output/** → `גיא`\n*(in parallel: `יובל` → yuval/outputs)*\n\nQA loop: 3 rounds max. גיא is the only agent allowed to reject.","x":480,"y":200,"width":460,"height":220,"color":"2"}
